{"2721420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who am I: Remedy", "steam_appid": 2721420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4638540], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WAKE UP.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Opening your eyes, you find yourself in a timeless space — a bridge between life and death. You hear the voices of scientists trying to help an unknown subject escape a time loop. You don't understand any of it and instinctively move toward the light, but... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/349e85ecdd0861b682632ae9f6c47d8e.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/349e85ecdd0861b682632ae9f6c47d8e.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RECORDING STARTED.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up in an empty house with no memory of your past. Armed with only an old camera and a typewriter you begin an investigation into the house’s past — and your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/ace8e25d28fc11e7e3c101f924f839d0.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/ace8e25d28fc11e7e3c101f924f839d0.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/ace8e25d28fc11e7e3c101f924f839d0.mp4?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CONDUCT THE INVESTIGATION.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The typewriter becomes your main investigative tool — through it, you read, document, and gradually piece the truth together.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/b6381b3e9260cf4db69ac1467555c004.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/b6381b3e9260cf4db69ac1467555c004.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/b6381b3e9260cf4db69ac1467555c004.mp4?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE HOUSE LEADS.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You realize the routes here cannot be trusted. Corridors shift, and passages open only when the house allows them to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/94972430b17ba3278ae3079faabaa6aa.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/94972430b17ba3278ae3079faabaa6aa.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/94972430b17ba3278ae3079faabaa6aa.mp4?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COLLECT FRAGMENTS OF THE PAST — COLLECT THE STORY.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solve puzzles and search for the artifacts, notes, and family photographs left behind in the house. Each discovery reveals new pieces of a larger story, bringing you closer to understanding who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/d16d51c15f3745160933c2b83fa68cd5.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1130 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/d16d51c15f3745160933c2b83fa68cd5.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/d16d51c15f3745160933c2b83fa68cd5.mp4?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AND REMEMBER, YOU ARE NOT ALONE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/4a89140d98c6da07637f671606d8ebb5.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/4a89140d98c6da07637f671606d8ebb5.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/4a89140d98c6da07637f671606d8ebb5.mp4?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror</strong> focused on <strong>tension</strong>, <strong>deep storytelling</strong> and <strong>puzzles</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive<strong> </strong> <strong>found footage</strong> effects;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your investigation on a <strong>typewriter</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who's <strong>calling</strong> on the other end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one person :)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always changing corridors;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>original soundtrack</strong> I wrote for deeper immersion;</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AI Generated Content Disclosure:</i> This game was created by a solo developer — an artist, game designer, and musician — with the intention of crafting a story players could enjoy and connect with. Some AI-generated content was used during development to support the game’s intended player experience and creative vision. All AI-assisted content was carefully reviewed, edited, and integrated by the developer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WAKE UP.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Opening your eyes, you find yourself in a timeless space — a bridge between life and death. You hear the voices of scientists trying to help an unknown subject escape a time loop. You don't understand any of it and instinctively move toward the light, but... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/349e85ecdd0861b682632ae9f6c47d8e.poster.avif?t=1783610996\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721420/extras/349e85ecdd0861b682632ae9f6c47d8e.webm?t=1783610996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RECORDING STARTED.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style